--
main.c:7
--
The early return on line 8 is merged at the end of the function under the
path condition (loop condition on line 6 AND n % i == 0 on line 7). The proof
uses that this condition is false. In the run it is false because the loop is
never entered (3 < 5 / 2 fails), so only line 6 is credited: line 7 is never
evaluated.
